/**
 * @file
 * @brief Mask Image with Image
 * Applies an image mask to another image.
 *
 * Image by Nicman on [Pixabay](https://pixabay.com/en/hummingbird-bird-trochilidae-flying-2139279/).
 *
 * @lastSavedInVuoVersion 2.4.6
